{"type": "vertex_text", "round": 1, "text": "I have completed the source-fidelity preflight review. The process included reading the inventor's disclosure, conversation, and the filing brief to establish the authoritative source for the invention's technical features. I then conducted a comprehensive review of the entire draft application, including the title, background, summary, detailed description, claims, abstract, numeral list, and all figure briefs.\n\nMy review involved building a complete source ledger, tracing every limitation in every claim, every numbered part in the description and numeral list, and every specific structure, relationship, and component described in the text and figure briefs to an exact, affirmative passage in the inventor's source documents. I also verified the internal consistency of the draft, ensuring that terminology is used consistently, that numerals uniquely identify parts, and that no drafting notes or placeholders remain.\n\nBased on this exhaustive review, I have found that every technical assertion in the draft is fully supported by the inventor's disclosure and that the application documents are internally consistent. There are no findings to report."}
